4: /**
5:  * D2R Memory Offset Constants
6:  * These offsets are for D2R v2.7+
7:  * 
8:  * Note: Offsets can shift with game patches. Use pattern scanning if exact offsets fail.
9:  * Signatures are provided as fallback pattern matching.
10:  */
